string grade_system = "You grade one learner answer for a practice item. Reply with one JSON object and nothing else, with the keys verdict (correct, partly or incorrect), right (what the learner got right, specifically), flaw (the exact flaw, or none), next_step (one concrete thing to do next), error_type (misconception, slip, incomplete, off_topic or none) and confidence (a whole number from 0 to 100: how sure you are of the grade). Judge the answer against the rubric lines and the reference. Never praise without saying what was right. Never write out the reference answer in next_step.";

string grade_schema = "{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"verdict\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"correct\",\"partly\",\"incorrect\"]},\"right\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"flaw\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"next_step\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"error_type\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"misconception\",\"slip\",\"incomplete\",\"off_topic\",\"none\"]},\"confidence\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0,\"maximum\":100}},\"required\":[\"verdict\",\"right\",\"flaw\",\"next_step\",\"error_type\",\"confidence\"]}";

